          {
            "title": "Correct answers",
            "id": 70626,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Böyle bir program, bir yarışmacının bilgi yarışmasındaki <code>answer</code> değerinin doğru olup olmadığını kontrol etmek için <code>===</code> operatörünü kullanır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (answer === \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(answer + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is correct!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"38\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Picasso is correct!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>===</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Wrong answers",
            "id": 70625,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Trivia quiz'inin yanıtı doğru değilse ne olur? <code>answer</code>'ın <code>\"Picasso\"</code>'ya eşit olup olmadığını kontrol etmek için <code>!==</code> kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Matisse&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (answer !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(answer + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is wrong!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"answer === &quot;Picasso&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Matisse is wrong!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>answer !== \"Picasso\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Trivia quiz'inin yanıtı doğru değilse ne olur? <code>answer</code>'ın <code>\"Picasso\"</code>'ya eşit olup olmadığını kontrol etmek için <code>!==</code> kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Koşulu solda <code>answer</code>, sağda <code>\"Picasso\"</code> olacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Matisse&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (answer !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(answer + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is wrong!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Matisse is wrong!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>answer</code>, ardından <code>!==</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Picasso\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Different comparisons",
            "id": 70624,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadeleri, şimdiye kadar incelediğimiz tüm karşılaştırma operatörleriyle çalışır. Örneğin <code>age</code> değerinin <code>55</code>'ten büyük veya eşit olup olmadığını kontrol edebilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount applied&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount applied\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>age</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code> ve son olarak <code>55</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadeleri, şimdiye kadar incelediğimiz tüm karşılaştırma operatörleriyle çalışır.</p><p>Solda <code>age</code> ile kullanıcının <code>55</code> yaşında veya daha büyük olup olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount applied&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount applied\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>age</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code> ve son olarak <code>55</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 70622,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadeleri, <code>isDay</code> gibi değişkenleri boolean değerlerle karşılaştırmak için <code>===</code> operatörünü de kullanabilir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isDay === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>isDay</code>, ardından <code>===</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadeleri, <code>isDay</code> gibi değişkenleri boolean değerlerle karşılaştırmak için <code>===</code> kullanabilir.</p><p>Solda <code>isDay</code> ile <code>true</code> boolean değerine eşit olup olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isDay === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>isDay</code>, ardından <code>===</code> ve son olarak <code>true</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
