            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>if deyimi koşulları için karşılaştırma yapmak üzere hangi operatörleri kullanabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>===</code> ve <code>!==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>===</code> ve <code>!==</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>===</code> ve <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
